<title>USA: Sioux City hogs steady - USDA.</title>
<headline>Sioux City hogs steady - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>SIOUX CITY 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA said trade was moderately active. Compared with Tuesday, barrows and gilts traded steady. Top $59.50 per cwt.</p>
<p>    US 1-3   220-270 lbs     59.00-59.50</p>
<p>		 270-280 lbs     58.50-59.00</p>
<p>    US 2-3   280-300 lbs     56.50-58.00</p>
<p>    US 3-4   300-330 lbs     54.00-56.00</p>
<p>Sows - up $1.00-1.50. Top $53.00.</p>
<p>    US 1-3   300-400 lbs     47.00</p>
<p>		 400-450 lbs     48.00</p>
<p>		 450-500 lbs     51.00</p>
<p>		 500-550 lbs     52.00-52.50</p>
<p>		 550-700 lbs     52.50-53.00</p>
</text>
